{"id":12032,"date":"2025-04-22T11:56:00","date_gmt":"2025-04-22T11:56:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/?p=12032"},"modified":"2026-05-27T09:15:56","modified_gmt":"2026-05-27T09:15:56","slug":"home-remodel-upgrades","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/home-remodel-upgrades\/","title":{"rendered":"10 Home Remodel Upgrades To Make Your Home More Luxury"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A home remodel is the perfect opportunity to elevate your space, blending functionality with luxury. Whether you\u2019re renovating a single room or transforming your entire home, certain upgrades can add a touch of opulence and significantly enhance your living experience. At Harris &amp; Sons, we specialize in creating luxurious spaces that fit your lifestyle. Here are 10 upgrades to consider for your next remodel to add unparalleled elegance and comfort.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you are looking for a more in-depth and personal discussion with our team regarding your specific project, feel free to book a hassle free, no obligation 1 on 1 virtual consultation with our Construction Consultant:<a href=\"https:\/\/api.leadconnectorhq.com\/widget\/bookings\/harris-sons-virtual-consultation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"\">&nbsp;<strong>Book a Call.<\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/image-16-1024x576.png\" alt=\"Home remodel upgrades\" class=\"wp-image-12034\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Top 10 Luxury Home Remodel Upgrades that are trending:<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. Smart Home Integration<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Bring your home into the future with smart technology that simplifies everyday life.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Features:<\/strong> Automated lighting, voice-controlled systems, smart thermostats, and integrated security cameras.<br><strong>Luxury Perks:<\/strong> Control your entire home from your smartphone or voice assistant, enhancing convenience and security.<br><strong>Example:<\/strong> Install motorized blinds that adjust automatically based on the time of day or temperature.<br><strong>Recommended Brands:<\/strong> Lutron Smart Lighting, Nest Thermostats,<a href=\"https:\/\/ring.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ring Security Systems<\/a>.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. Heated Floors<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Radiant floor heating adds a cozy touch to bathrooms, kitchens, and even bedrooms.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Benefits:<\/strong> Say goodbye to cold tiles in the winter. Heated floors provide consistent warmth and energy efficiency.<br><strong>Fact:<\/strong> Radiant heating can reduce energy costs by up to 15% compared to forced-air systems (<a href=\"https:\/\/www.energy.gov\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Energy.gov<\/a>).<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Spa-Like Bathrooms<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Transform your bathroom into a personal retreat with high-end features.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Features:<\/strong> Rainfall showers, freestanding soaking tubs, heated towel racks, and touchless faucets.<br><strong>Example:<\/strong> Add a steam shower with aromatherapy options for a rejuvenating spa experience at home.<br><strong>Recommended Brands:<\/strong> Kohler Steam Showers,<a href=\"https:\/\/www.moen.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Moen Smart Faucets<\/a>.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. Custom Walk-In Closets<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A well-organized, spacious closet can turn a daily routine into a luxury experience.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Features:<\/strong> Built-in shelving, LED lighting, a central island, and velvet-lined drawers for delicate items.<br><strong>Luxury Perks:<\/strong> A dedicated space for your wardrobe keeps everything neat, accessible, and beautifully displayed.<br><strong>Example:<\/strong> Include full-length mirrors and a seating area for added functionality.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. Gourmet Kitchens<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Elevate your kitchen to a chef\u2019s paradise with top-tier upgrades.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Features:<\/strong> High-end appliances like Sub-Zero refrigerators and Wolf ranges, a large kitchen island, and custom cabinetry.<br><strong>Luxury Add-Ons:<\/strong> A wine fridge, built-in coffee station, or pot-filler faucet over the stove.<br><strong>Example:<\/strong> Install quartz or marble countertops for a sleek, sophisticated finish.<br><strong>Recommended Brands:<\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.subzero-wolf.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sub-Zero Appliances<\/a>,<a href=\"https:\/\/www.caesarstoneus.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Caesarstone Quartz<\/a>.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><\/strong><strong>6. Home Theaters<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Bring the cinematic experience to your home with a custom theater setup.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Features:<\/strong> Surround sound systems, plush recliner seating, and a high-definition projector.<br><strong>Luxury Perks:<\/strong> Soundproof walls ensure an immersive experience without disrupting the rest of the house.<br><strong>Example:<\/strong> Include a popcorn machine or mini-bar for added entertainment value.<br><strong>Recommended Brands:<\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.sonos.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Sonos Surround Systems<\/a>, Epson Projectors.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/AD_4nXcvrTSQ3HVWwdw0GtDYQ2BMhi9SQuG1yS92cOI7N-XUy4dtF8Hk-k-MPuUFqdefLIftkfDCLLc7bAju6v15Hx3ybiOi_0AWjCQNV_ato5GX8083wW9ASwh5PVeyOkPywB9nYYV17w.jpg\" alt=\"Home remodel specialist\" class=\"wp-image-12037\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>7. Outdoor Living Spaces<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Extend your luxury lifestyle outdoors with functional and beautiful upgrades.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Features:<\/strong> Outdoor kitchens, fire pits, heated patios, and custom pools.<br><strong>Example:<\/strong> Install a pergola with built-in lighting and heating elements for year-round use in Oregon&#8217;s climate.<br><strong>Recommended Brands:<\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.trex.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Trex Decking<\/a>,<a href=\"https:\/\/www.napoleon.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Napoleon Grills<\/a>.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>8. High-End Lighting Fixtures<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Lighting sets the mood and elevates the aesthetic of any space.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Features:<\/strong> Chandeliers, recessed lighting, and under-cabinet LED strips.<br><strong>Luxury Perks:<\/strong> Dimmable and color-adjustable options let you tailor the ambiance to any occasion.<br><strong>Example:<\/strong> Add a statement chandelier to your dining room for a sophisticated centerpiece.<br><strong>Recommended Brands:<\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.rh.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Restoration Hardware Lighting<\/a>,<a href=\"https:\/\/www.philips-hue.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Philips Hue Smart Lighting<\/a>.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>9. Wine Cellars<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For wine enthusiasts, a custom cellar adds both functionality and luxury.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Features:<\/strong> Climate-controlled storage, elegant shelving, and tasting nooks.<br><strong>Example:<\/strong> Install glass walls to showcase your collection and create a conversation piece.<br><strong>Recommended Brands:<\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.whisperkool.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WhisperKool Cooling Systems<\/a>.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>10. Enhanced Entryways<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Make a stunning first impression with a grand entryway.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Features:<\/strong> Double doors, custom ironwork, marble or tile flooring, and a dramatic chandelier.<br><strong>Luxury Perks:<\/strong> An elegant entryway sets the tone for the rest of your home\u2019s aesthetic.<br><strong>Example:<\/strong> Incorporate a smart doorbell system for added security and convenience.<br><strong>Recommended Brands:<\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/ring.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ring Video Doorbells<\/a><br><br>The ROI of Luxury Home Remodel Upgrades<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Above all,iInvesting in luxury upgrades can also increase your home\u2019s value:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Statistic:<\/strong> High-end kitchens offer an ROI of 60-80%, while spa-like bathrooms return approximately 70% on average (Remodeling Magazine).<br><strong>Case Study:<\/strong> A Oregon homeowner added a custom walk-in closet and gourmet kitchen. These upgrades increased their home\u2019s resale value by $75,000, recovering 85% of the remodeling costs.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why You Should Hire a Designer for the Details<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Luxury is in the details, and hiring a professional designer ensures every element is cohesive and functional:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Benefits:<\/strong> Designers bring expertise in space planning, color theory, and material selection.<br>\u2022 <strong>Example:<\/strong> A designer can recommend unique lighting fixtures or custom cabinetry that aligns with your style while maximizing your space.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How Hiring a General Contractor Makes Your Project Luxury<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A skilled general contractor ensures that your remodel meets the highest standards:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Benefits:<\/strong> Professional coordination, access to high-end materials, and adherence to timelines.<br>\u2022 <strong>Example:<\/strong> At Harris &amp; Sons, our Oregon Preconstruction Process streamlines every detail to deliver luxurious results.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Choose even do Luxury Home Remodel Upgrades?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Also, luxury upgrades create a space tailored to your lifestyle, enhancing both comfort and functionality. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Improve Daily Living:<\/strong> Features like heated floors and smart home integration simplify everyday tasks.<br><strong>Increase Home Value:<\/strong> High-end finishes and unique design elements boost resale potential.<br><strong>Provide Long-Term Enjoyment:<\/strong> Investing in quality ensures durability and timeless appeal.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Preconstruction: The Key to a Successful Home Remodel Upgrades<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Preconstruction planning ensures a seamless remodeling process:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Features:<\/strong> Detailed budgeting, timeline creation, and issue anticipation.<br><strong>Example:<\/strong> Preconstruction helped a Oregon client avoid $10,000 in unexpected costs by identifying structural issues early.<br><strong>Learn More:<\/strong> Oregon Preconstruction Process.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Final Thought<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Luxury is in the details. With thoughtful upgrades, you can transform your home into a space that exudes elegance and comfort. At Harris &amp; Sons, we specialize in bringing your vision to life, offering expert guidance throughout the Oregon Preconstruction Process to ensure your remodel delivers the sophistication and functionality you desire. <strong>Ready to elevate your home?<br><\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/contact-us\/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/contact-us\/\">Contact Harris &amp; Sons <\/a>today to discuss your remodeling plans and explore how we can create a luxurious space tailored to your lifestyle.<br><a href=\"https:\/\/share.google\/gwM2ovux57i85a4fn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Get in Touch<\/a> | <a title=\"\" href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/services\/\">Explore Our Services<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>A home remodel is the perfect opportunity to elevate your space, blending functionality with luxury. Whether you\u2019re renovating a single room or transforming your entire home, certain upgrades can add a touch of opulence and significantly enhance your living experience. At Harris &amp; Sons, we specialize in creating luxurious spaces that fit your lifestyle. Here [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":12034,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[41],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-12032","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-home-remodeling"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\